HI PHAT SINH LIEN QUAN DEN HAY DO VIEC CONG TY THANH TOAN\n\nKHOAN TIEN NAY CHO NGUOI DUOC UY QUYEN NEU TREN.\n\nGIAY UY QUYEN NAY CHI CO HIEU LUC TRONG VONG BA (03) THANG KE TU NGAY KY VA CO GIA TRI RANG BUOC DOI VOI\n\nNHUNG NGUOI DAI DIEN CUA CA NHAN TOI, NHUNG NGUOI THUA KE VA/ HOAC QUAN LY DI SAN CUA TOI.\n\nBEN MUA BAO  CHUYEN VIEN TU VAN BAO HIEM DUOC UY  NGUOI LAM  XAC NHAN CUA\n\nHIEM  QUYEN  CHUNG  ADM\n\n(KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)  (KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)  (KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)  (KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)\n\nLUU Y: DE NGHI BEN MUA BAO HIEM KY DUNG VOI CHU KY DA DANG KY GIAO DICH VOI CONG TY\n\nMOI SUA CHUA TREN GIAY UY QUYEN PHAI CO CHU KY XAC NHAN CUA BEN UY QUYEN\n\nPOSF8059", "html": "<p>SO 297 GIAI PHONG, MY AN, NGU HANH SON, DA NANG</p>\n<p>Tel: 0359807126</p>\n<p>www.congtytnhhbaohiemn.vn</p>\n<p>TRUNG TAM DICH VU KHACH HANG</p>\n<p>CONG TY TNHH BAO HIEM NHAN THO VIET TIN</p>\n<h1>GIAY UY QUYEN NHAN TIEN</h1>\n<h2>(CHI AP DUNG CHO TRUONG HOP UY QUYEN CHO CHUYEN VIEN TU VAN BAO HIEM NHAN PHI BAO HIEM HOAN LAI VOI SO TIEN NHO HON</h2>\n<h2>5.000.000 DONG)</h2>\n<p>HO VA TEN (CHU IN HOA) LE QUANG DAO</p>\n<p>SO CMND 221607014</p>\n<p>NGAY CAP 14/03/2021</p>\n<p>NOI CAP HA NOI</p>\n<p>LA BEN MUA BAO HIEM CUA HOP DONG BAO HIEM/HO SO YEU CAU BAO HIEM SO: 48209112</p>\n<p>HO VA TEN (CHU IN HOA) PHAM THI BICH NGOC</p>\n<p>SO CMND 854758650</p>\n<p>NGAY CAP 18/07/2021</p>\n<p>NOI CAP TPHCM</p>\n<p>DIA CHI PHUONG 4 - TAN BINH - TPHCM</p>\n<p>MA SO TU VAN 26077012</p>\n<p>DIEN THOAI 0992631640</p>\n<p>BANG SO: 4,002,000</p>\n<p>BANG CHU: BON TRIEU KHONG TRAM LE HAI NGHIN DONG</p>\n<p>THEO THONG BAO CUA CONG TY NGAY 01/10/2026</p>\n<p>TOI XAC NHAN RANG TREN CO SO KHI CONG TY THANH TOAN SO TIEN NEU TREN CHO NGUOI DUOC UY QUYEN, CONG</p>\n<p>TY DUOC:</p>\n<p>1) MIEN TRU KHOI MOI KHIEU NAI HAY YEU CAU BOI THUONG CUA TOI DOI VOI CONG TY VE KHOAN THANH TOAN NOI</p>\n<p>TREN.</p>\n<p>2) TOI BOI HOAN VA GIU CHO CONG TY KHONG PHAI CHI TRA BAT KY KHOAN TIEN GI DOI VOI TAT CA CAC YE